# Photo Album AI

Create beautiful photo albums with AI assistance. Upload photos, tell your story, and let AI select and arrange the perfect shots.

## Quick Start

### Run Locally

```bash
# 1. Install dependencies
npm install

# 2. Start the development server
npm start

# 3. Open http://localhost:3000 in your browser
```

### Deploy to Vercel (Free)

1. Go to https://vercel.com
2. Click "New Project"
3. Connect your GitHub repository
4. Deploy (it's automatic!)

### Deploy to Netlify (Free)

1. Go to https://app.netlify.com/drop
2. Drag this folder into the window
3. Wait 30 seconds for your live URL

## How to Use

1. **Get an API Key**
   - Go to https://console.anthropic.com/
   - Create a free account
   - Generate an API key
   - Save it (keep it secret!)

2. **Upload Photos**
   - Click "Choose Photos"
   - Select 5-50 photos from your computer

3. **Tell Your Story**
   - Describe what the album is about
   - Be specific about the mood and context

4. **AI Analyzes**
   - Claude analyzes all your photos
   - Selects the best ones
   - Suggests an order

5. **Choose Style**
   - Pick from 4 design styles
   - Toggle image enhancement on/off

6. **Review & Edit**
   - Reorder photos
   - Add captions
   - Edit title

7. **Export**
   - Click "Export to PDF"
   - Save to your computer
   - Ready to print!

## Features

✨ **Smart Photo Selection** - AI ranks photos by quality and emotional impact
🎨 **4 Style Templates** - Classic, Modern, Editorial, Minimal
📝 **Full Editing Control** - Reorder, caption, customize everything
🖼️ **Image Enhancement** - Optional AI-powered brightness/contrast adjustments
📄 **Print-Ready PDF** - Export with perfect spacing and formatting

## System Requirements

- Modern web browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)
- Internet connection
- Anthropic API key (free tier available)

## Technical Stack

- React 18
- Tailwind CSS
- Anthropic Claude API
- Lucide Icons

## Notes

- Photos are processed in your browser (private)
- No data is stored (session-based)
- Requires valid API key for AI features
- Supports JPG, PNG, WebP, GIF formats

## Support

For issues or questions:
1. Check your API key is valid
2. Try refreshing the page
3. Ensure you have a stable internet connection

